The seed is 2026.
The east is 0.
The north is 0.
The accepted is 0.
Repeat while accepted is 0.
Set seed to seed times 1103515245 plus 12345.
Set seed to seed modulo 2147483648.
Set east to seed modulo 200001 minus 100000.
Set seed to seed times 1103515245 plus 12345.
Set seed to seed modulo 2147483648.
Set north to seed modulo 200001 minus 100000.
The reach is east times east plus north times north.
If reach is at most 10000000000, set accepted to 1.

The eastparts is an empty list of text.
The eastsize is the absolute value of east.
The eastwhole is eastsize divided by 100000.
The eastfraction is eastsize modulo 100000.
If east is less than 0, Place "-" into eastparts.
The easthead is format whole number eastwhole as text.
Place easthead into eastparts.
Place "." into eastparts.
The divisor is 10000.
For every digit from 0 to 4.
The part is eastfraction divided by divisor modulo 10.
The parttext is format whole number part as text.
Place parttext into eastparts.
Set divisor to divisor divided by 10.

The easttext is join eastparts with "".
The northparts is an empty list of text.
The northsize is the absolute value of north.
The northwhole is northsize divided by 100000.
The northfraction is northsize modulo 100000.
If north is less than 0, Place "-" into northparts.
The northhead is format whole number northwhole as text.
Place northhead into northparts.
Place "." into northparts.
Set divisor to 10000.
For every digit from 0 to 4.
The part is northfraction divided by divisor modulo 10.
The parttext is format whole number part as text.
Place parttext into northparts.
Set divisor to divisor divided by 10.

The northtext is join northparts with "".
Show easttext.
Show northtext.
